~ start

if station.get_port_zone().get("style", "AUTOMATED") == "STAFFED"
	Dockmaster: This is the dock, go ahead.
else
	Port Control: State your business.
- Request docking. [if not player.is_docked_at(station) /]
	do result = station.request_docking_via_control(player)
	do outcome = result["outcome"]
	if outcome == "granted"
		do grant = result["grant"]
		do slip = grant["slip_id"]
		Port Control: Copy that. Cleared to berth {{ slip }}. Welcome in.
		=> END
	elif outcome == "already_docked"
		do slip = result["slip_id"]
		Port Control: Check your board -- you are already berthed at {{ slip }}.
		=> start
	elif outcome == "out_of_zone"
		Port Control: Negative, you are outside our control zone. Close range and re-request.
		=> start
	elif outcome == "stalled"
		Port Control: Stand by...
		=> start
	else
		Port Control: Negative, we have no open berths. Hold position.
		=> start
- Request undock. [if player.is_docked_at(station) /]
	do player.request_undock()
	Port Control: Copy, releasing you. Watch your separation.
	=> END
- Never mind. (Disconnect)
	=> END
